ext","text":"[computer:wait] waited 8s\n\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"U Montajı\" (\"http://127.0.0.1:8766/claude-hat3-v8/otonom/hat/u-montaj.html\")"},{"type":"text","text":"[read_console_messages] No console logs.\n\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"U Montajı\" (\"http://127.0.0.1:8766/claude-hat3-v8/otonom/hat/u-montaj.html\")"},{"type":"text","text":"[get_page_text] Title: U Montajı\nURL: http://127.0.0.1:8766/claude-hat3-v8/otonom/hat/u-montaj.html\nSource element: <body>\n---\nStore›HAT›Makine v3›U montajı\n← Makineye dön\nU · ÜST KABİNLER — U_F, U_KE, F üst kabini + ana panoüretim sacı v1 · adım adım\n\nHattın üst kabinleri: F üstündeki U_F (ana pano burada), K + E üstündeki U_KE ve F'nin üst kabini (davlumbaz bölmesi, panjur, taban yalıtımı). Önce sac kabuklar, sonra ana pano, kanallar, kablolar, havalandırma ve yedek stok.\n\nDiğer istasyonlar: A · B · TOPPING · F · E · U\n\nKamera: otomatik\n◀◀\n❚❚\n▶▶\n0,0 / 0 sn\nHIZ\n0,5×\n1×\n2×\n4×\nGÖRÜNÜM\nKenar çizgileri\nKesit\nX\nY\nZ\n1 · Lazer kesim\n2 · PEM saplama / somun basma\n3 · Abkant büküm\n4 · F üst kabini · profiller · taban · yalıtı\n\n[truncated to 600 chars]\n\n\nTab Context:\n- Executed on tabId: seed\n- Available tabs:\n  • tabId seed: \"U Montajı\" (\"http://127.0.0.1:8766/claude-hat3-v8/otonom/hat/u-montaj.html\")"}]}]},"uuid":"2f708d5f-c20c-46c1-bf93-6df124a829a3","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:08:20.253Z","classifierBoundary":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dc8c3c7b-52b3-4422-90a4-6e7a76b545f3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
